summary.label:
Automatically click anywhere on the custom web pages or web games you want with custom durations.
Use it on your favorite sites (dating, social media platforms, novels, news, games).
Install AutoTap right now to save your time.

We currently support the following features: 
- Auto Clicks: up to 5 clicks at the same time;
- Split Screen: click on 2 browsers ;
- Auto Scroll: read news or books without the need to scroll while reading;
- Auto Refresh: refresh your webpage on a given interval;
- Auto Screenshots: snap screenshots automatically and save them on your device;
- Ad Blocker: block annoying ads while browsing in our in-app browsers.  

